  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-004">Single IJobHandler implementation registered in L2 DI.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-010">Register in L2 control-plane, NOT BFF.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-036">Reuse background-job infrastructure; return 202; fire-and-forget.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-044">registryEnvId + sample assertion GUIDs follow canonicalization.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Idempotency key: validate-{customerId}-{buildId} — buildId is BFF CI build number.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Assert EFFECTS not intentions (R7 principle): sample-run every acceptance check; do NOT trust upstream handler telemetry alone.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Setup Status transition to Ready is CONDITIONAL on ALL: 6 T1–T6 traps clear + 5 I1–I5 invariants clear + naming-conformance exit 0 + cost envelope conform + all sample E2E checks pass. Partial-pass does NOT transition.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">On failure: Cosmos state = Quarantined per §4C rollback semantics (blocks new runs against same customerId until operator clears).</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md SC #5">Extended Validate-DeployedEnvironment.ps1 exits 0 asserting BFF /health + sample analysis + sample doc upload+index + workspace-layout render + wizard field-map.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md SC #6">All 6 §4B T1–T6 traps verified by owning handler's post-condition — H13 re-verifies each independently.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md SC #17">scripts/naming-conformance-check.ps1 exits 0 on r1-owned surfaces post-provisioning.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md §4D I1..I5">Sample-verify each invariant: I1 grep provisioning scripts for tenant-shaped GUID defaults; I2 sample AI Search query per index confirms tenantId filter; I3 sample Cosmos query confirms partition-key; I4 SPE container ID resolution goes through ITenantContainerResolver; I5 Graph token per-tenant scoped.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec.md §15 #14">Cost envelope: Model 2 empty ≤ $400/mo; Model 1 marginal ≤ $430/mo; shared floor ≤ $400/mo. &gt;20% deviation is cost drift (advisory-warn default; escalate per spec.md Unresolved Questions).</constraint>
  </constraints>

